The[ girls][ come][ dressed] in simple meet[ dresses] and[ they][ make][ a][ perfect] friend for your other 18″ dolls, are great as[ a] starter[ doll][ for][ a] young girl who is[ just] getting into[ dolls] or as[ a] model for your sewing projects.[ Like] American Girl dolls, they have vinyl[ faces] and[ limbs] and[ soft] bodies.[ The] Springfield[ Girls] limbs are not str[ung] like American Girl,[ rather][ they][ are] se[wn] in[.] The girls[ have][ a][ hard][ time][ standing] without shoes on,[ but] once you[ dress] them[ up] and put[ shoes] on their[ feet][,] they[ do] great![
]In[ this] photo[ Abby] and Madison[ are] modeling some of[ the][ outfits] we received[ for][ review][.] Abby[ is][ wearing] the Pl[aid] Tunic[ and][ Le]ggings[ outfit][ ($]9[.][95]) with a pair[ of] Springfield Collection Crocs that we[ already][ had][.] Madison is[ so] com[fy] in the Paj[amas][ and] Bunny[ sl]ippers from the[ P]ajamar[ama] Set which includes two pair of jammies and slippers for[ $][16][.][99].[ Madison][ is] very happy to[ be] here and immediately went to the library and[ picked][ out] her favorite[ Cec]ile book and found the comfy[ chair] I had made earlier this fall.
