Finally, the mains. Chicken with Cas[hew][ nuts][ was] another[ traditional] dish done[ well], but Fillet[ of] Beef[ in] Claypot was the[ star] performer,[ arriving] still sizz[ling] at[ the] table[,] the flavour[ of] the meat more than living up to the spectacle.
